{"version":1,"content":"<p>教宗良十四世周二（13日）接受肺結節切除手術，確診患有肺腺癌。</p><p>梵蒂岡周五（16日）發布教宗接受手術後照片，可見71歲的教宗身穿綠色祭衣，在醫院主持彌撒，並形容教宗「心情很好」、「恢復良好」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T03:39:08.587124+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T03:20:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T02:57:34.449802+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T03:37:32.693409+00:00","content_hash":"33fa3dc34be2f08f5e0fd9bd5cc6e9521423a72553a206d2a3256ed39cb6e655","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}